WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
How our agents write in your voice.

00:03.600 --> 00:09.300
Each call is recorded. Nothing gets lost.

00:09.400 --> 00:14.300
An agent gathers everything by email.

00:14.400 --> 00:18.900
It all reaches P0, our project coordinator.

00:19.000 --> 00:24.300
P0 writes the brief, with your voice at its centre.

00:24.400 --> 00:31.300
The agent uses your actual words. It feels human.

00:31.400 --> 00:35.900
You review it. Nothing goes out without your approval.

00:36.000 --> 00:41.300
The more it listens, the more it sounds like you.
Each transcript teaches it your words.
